TEXT 1528 -1968 Left 2 !*Common-Mode Choke Parameters\n*Lchoke = Inductance of one winding with other winding open\n*Rp     = Ferromagnetic Core Losses. Model as parallel resistor\n*Cp     = Equivalent, effective capacitance between one pair\n*         of transformer winding\n*Llkg   = Leakage inductance with other winding shorted (taken from datasheet)\n \n \n.param R_DCR = 10m\n.param Lchoke = 35u\n.param Llkg = 275n\n.param Cp = 30p\n.param Rp = 1k
TEXT 384 -1832 Left 2 !.ac dec 1k 10 40Meg
TEXT 392 -1728 Left 2 !*Z0 = System's characteristic Impedance\n*Z0 = 50 Ohms typically as a standard\n*Z0 = 50 Ohms for this simulation\n \n.param Z0 = 50.0\n \n*.net statement used for S-parameter simulations\n \n.net I(RL_DM) VG_DM\n.net I(RL_CM) VG_CM
TEXT 3064 -1976 Left 2 !*Differential Capacitor Parameters\n* Ls = Series inductance\n* Rs = Equivalent series resistance \n* C = Nominal capacitance\n.param Ls_dm = 10n\n.param Rs_dm = 30m\n.param C_dm = 2.2u\n \n*Differential Capacitor Model\n*Series RLC\n.subckt C_diff_mode 1 2\nLs 1 3 {Ls_dm}\nRs 3 4 {Rs_dm}\nC1 4 2 {C_dm}\n.backanno\n.end
TEXT 2560 -1968 Left 2 !*Common-Mode Capacitor Parameters\n* Ls = Series inductance\n* Rs = Equivalent series resistance \n* C = Nominal capacitance\n.param Ls_cm = 10n\n.param Rs_cm = 200m\n.param C_cm = 0.1u\n \n*Common-Mode Capacitor Model\n*Series RLC\n.subckt C_comm_mode 1 2\nLs 1 3 {Ls_cm}\nRs 3 4 {Rs_cm}\nC1 4 2 {C_cm}\n.backanno\n.end
TEXT 1304 288 Left 2 !K3 L5 L6 1
TEXT 2832 280 Right 2 !K4 L7 L8 1
TEXT 1584 -2088 Left 7 ;User-Settable Device Parameters
TEXT 272 -2088 Left 7 ;Simulation Control\nand Settings
TEXT 792 -136 Left 5 ;CTX01-17342 Common-Mode Choke
TEXT 2424 -144 Left 5 ;CTX01-17342 Common-Mode Choke
TEXT 1520 -296 Left 6 ;MQPI-18 EMI Filter Module
TEXT 1520 -1488 Left 2 !*Polarized Capacitor Parameters\n* Ls = Series inductance\n* Rs = Equivalent series resistance \n* C = Nominal capacitance\n.param Ls_pol = 50n\n.param Rs_pol = 100m\n.param C_pol = 47u\n \n*Polarized Capacitor Model\n*Series RLC\n.subckt Cpol_47u 1 2\nLs 1 3 {Ls_pol}\nRs 3 4 {Rs_pol}\nC1 4 2 {C_pol}\n.backanno\n.end
